# Neon Postgres connection string.
# Get it from https://console.neon.tech → your project → Connection Details.
# Use the POOLED connection (host ends in -pooler.<region>.neon.tech) — Vercel
# serverless functions have very short lifetimes and need pgbouncer-style pooling.
DATABASE_URL=
# Direct (non-pooled) connection — used only by Prisma for migrations.
# Same host as DATABASE_URL but without "-pooler" in it.
DIRECT_DATABASE_URL=
